cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper it accompanies."
title: "MPCF: certified finite-budget mission-path fortification"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of MPCF (Mission-Path Cut Fortification), a certified
  solver for placing a finite protection budget on the nodes of a directed
  equipment network so that the worst-case adaptive, cost-weighted mission-path
  cut is minimised. Provides a compact MILP (MPCF-Exact), a cut-generation solver
  with exact PathCut separation (MPCF-CG), a one-step marginal ablation
  (MPCF-Greedy), the graph-clustered statistical analysis, the seed-extension
  robustness analysis, and the acceptance gates used for the published results.
type: software
version: "0.8.5"
